{"title": "Shadespell", "pageid": 28333, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadespell", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Shadespell</b> is a passive feature that enhances your spells while in shadow.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While the wearer is <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a> in shadow, their spells gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a>, making them more likely to succeed. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Shadespell\"> Condition: Shadespell </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadespell_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadespell (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadespell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadespell_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadespell (Condition)\">Shadespell</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>As long as it remains obscured, the affected entity has +1 to spell save <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">DC</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadespell_Circlet\" title=\"The Shadespell Circlet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/The_Shadespell_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadespell_Circlet\" title=\"The Shadespell Circlet\">The Shadespell Circlet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204455\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1191/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10183/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2085/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion d